WEBVTT

1
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,450
Suffering from mecha for thirty years

2
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:23,890
It’s rare to see a knife like this once

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:26,490
This guy's future is limitless

4
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,210
When you return to the mecha, you will still step on insects.

5
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:29,810
Will he leave any yellow deer for us?

6
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,880
It's faster than three days this time

7
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:52,280
Now it's over 400%

8
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,760
The server at Tianci Center is about to emit smoke.

9
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,560
Four hundred. If you need money, why don’t you pay back three hundred?

10
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,120
Okay, let's go to the conference room

11
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,580
Furnace Hunter S-level general

12
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,460
Six years to kill the federation

13
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,140
At least two ace mecha companies

14
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:12,170
I was killed by you today

15
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:17,760
The Federation has been chasing him for six years.

16
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:24,120
He actually showed up on his own initiative

17
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:30,320
He was hunted from the sky

18
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:35,900
Chu Yao copied Tianlie Zuobiao half a month ago

19
00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:37,860
The research team repeatedly tested the evidence

20
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:40,380
The position is locked in the Cangxing synchronous orbit and the backlight goes out.

21
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:42,100
but there is a problem

22
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:45,230
Tianlie is wrapped by a layer of high-screen spatial pleats

23
00:01:45,230 --> 00:01:47,830
All detection signals are refracted

24
00:01:47,830 --> 00:01:49,590
The location is confirmed but the internal structure

25
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:51,070
Troop size and trends

26
00:01:51,070 --> 00:01:52,350
Completely undetectable

27
00:01:52,350 --> 00:01:53,780
found us
